12. Prometheus UI shows `siem-service` target `UP` and the Grafana baseline dashboard renders all panels without "No data" except where genuinely zero.
13. `RECON.md` and `REGRESSION.md` are present in the diff and accurate.
14. The diff does not modify any service implementation outside `siem-service` other than the explicit additions to `rbac.go`, the gateway routes file, compose, ecosystem, Prometheus config, and the auth-db migration.

