- The role `analyst` / `tenant_admin` / `super_admin` does not exist (do not invent — ask).
- An existing service's tests fail under the new branch — even one. (Investigate first, but if root cause is platform-level, ask.)
- The audit chain client API has changed since the prompt was authored.
- The gateway route binding model uses different symbol names than §4.5 assumes.

The agent must produce a numbered list of unresolved questions and stop. Do not silently adapt.

