## 12. Rollback plan

To reverse SIEM-01 cleanly:
1. `git revert <merge_commit>` on the foundation branch.
2. `make compose-down && make compose-up` — siem-service no longer present, all other services healthy.
3. Roll back the auth-db migration: `migrate -path migrations/auth_db -database "$AUTH_DSN" down 1`.
4. Drop the SIEM database: `psql -c "DROP DATABASE siem_db;"`.
5. Confirm gateway no longer advertises `/api/v1/siem/**` (`curl` returns 404).
6. Confirm Prometheus no longer scrapes the missing target (target list does not contain `siem-service`).

The rollback must leave the platform byte-identical to the pre-SIEM-01 state — no orphaned permissions, no orphaned migrations, no orphaned containers.

